			subtitle: "Welcome Power User!"
			description: [
				"&2Greetings new Power User! &n&lYou have chosen or been chosen to be digitized fully into our FOPGame Server&r&2! We welcome you with open arms!"
				""
				"&2Here you will find many things to do, but our main attraction is &n&lVault Hunters&r&2, which everything revolves around!"
				""
				"&2As you are digitzed into our GameServer, please be careful! As per the Terms of Service, Power Users maintain full control of their digital bodies, which includes our Survival System! Please take care and manage your Health, Oxygen, Sustenance, and all future systems!"
				""
				"&2The FOPGame Server has &n&ltwo major Zones&r&2 : &n&lThe Mainland&r&2, which consists of the Overworld, Nether, and End; and &n&lThe Vaults&r&2, which are temporary portals into special worlds! "
				""
				"&2To continue, please follow the included Vault Hunter's Guidebook to get up to speed! Then &n&lsubmit (5) five Chromatic Iron Ingots&r&2 to continue!"
			]
			dependencies: ["31711C6DAB9BA2E5"]
