			subtitle: "DLC For Your Benefit!"
			description: [
				"&2[Thank you for purchasing NEW PLAYER INTRODUCTION PART 2]"
				""
				"&2As you may have noticed, &n&lmuch of the game's content is not accessable to a new Power User&r&2. This is for your &n&lsafety&r&2!"
				""
				"&2Our GameServer is a very &n&lin depth and complicated&r&2 series of systems, and as such we must ensure you can &n&lsynergize&r&2 with things at a safe pace! Chapters within the Vault Hunters Guidebook will unlock at a manageable pace for a New Power User!"
				""
				"&2You are currently what we call an &n&lIR Power User&r&2! That stands for InfraRed, our starter Power User tier! You have access to range of &n&lbasic recipes, the Mainland, and most importantly : The ability to enter Vaults&r&2! "
