			shape: "octagon"
			description: [
				"Hey there! This is Caigan, actual Caigan, the modpack dev."
				""
				"This pack is built around Wold's Vaults, which is a modpack that is a custom spinoff of the original Vault Hunters 3rd Edition, but with many added or changed mods, items, and mechanics. So you could say this is a spinoff of a spinoff!"
				""
				"Please keep in mind : balancing in this pack is handled differently than both Wolds and Vanilla VH. The addition of the FMC and Grist systems (more on those later) fundamentally change how balance is approached."
				""
				"My goal is to strike a balance between Vault Hunters/Wold's Vaults and the core balancing I had with The Ferret Business 1."
				""
				"This Q.U.E.S.T. Tablet will go over many of the new and additional items and mechanics as you follow it. It will also provide a more in depth guide to playing Vault Hunters as a whole than the VH Quest Book."
